erName":"綺珊","textMapHash":1977052514,"text":"…ですから、この部分の材料費をこんなに削るべきではないと思います。","nextNodeIds":[230200102]},{"nodeId":230200102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":106161738,"text":"大丈夫だって、ここの強度は十分に足りてる。そこは何度も計算した。","nextNodeIds":[230200103]},{"nodeId":230200103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4031,"speakerName":"綺珊","textMapHash":3494175290,"text":"はあ、計算では予測できない問題もたくさんあると言ったはずです…","nextNodeIds":[230200104]},{"nodeId":230200104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3618504010,"text":"何を言い争ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[230200105]},{"nodeId":230200105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1202565418,"text":"おお、君か。あの船の設計について話し合ってたのさ。","nextNodeIds":[230200106]},{"nodeId":230200106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1849856002,"text":"俺は船体強度を何度も計算して、安全性を確認したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230200107]},{"nodeId":230200107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1890948746,"text":"なのに綺珊は強度が不安だと言って譲らない…","nextNodeIds":[230200108]},{"nodeId":230200108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4031,"speakerName":"綺珊","textMapHash":3918844770,"text":"あなたの言う「強度」は、あくまで机上の空論でしかありません。","nextNodeIds":[230200109]},{"nodeId":230200109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4031,"speakerName":"綺珊","textMapHash":2150810530,"text":"実際に船が進水したときに受ける力は、この数値をはるかに上回るはずです。","nextNodeIds":[230200110]},{"nodeId":230200110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":2154410010,"text":"理屈は分らんでもない…だが、手元のカネには限りがあるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[230200111]},{"nodeId":230200111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":579089082,"text":"もっと高い材料を買うことになってみろ、そうなったら、せいぜい竜骨を作っておしまいだぜ…コホンッ！","nextNodeIds":[230200112]},{"nodeId":230200112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":2143974754,"text":"とにかく！この船は俺のプランで進めるぞ。材料だってもう全部買ってある。","nextNodeIds":[230200113]},{"nodeId":230200113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":3417656602,"text":"旅人、もしよければ、材料の一部を先に運んでくれないか？俺一人じゃ運びきれなくてさ…","nextNodeIds":[230200114,230200115]},{"nodeId":230200114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4193187890,"text":"いいよ。","nextNodeIds":[230200118]},{"nodeId":230200118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":3643473858,"text":"じゃあ頼んだぞ、俺はここで計算を続ける。それが終わったら、残りの材料も運ぶよ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230200115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1944935906,"text":"綺珊も造船に詳しいの？","nextNodeIds":[230200116]},{"nodeId":230200116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":312504082,"text":"そりゃそうだ。こと計算に関して言えば、俺より速いくらいだぜ。","nextNodeIds":[230200117]},{"nodeId":230200117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":62909322,"text":"なんであいつ、ここで店員なんかやってるんだろうな…","nextNodeIds":[230200118]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2302001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4032 "],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2302002,"order":2,"stepDescription":"船の修理に使う物資を取りに行く","stepDescTextMapHash":2644028612,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2302002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_IND